{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 -c 'import jsonschema; print(jsonschema.__file__)'; cat CLAUDE.md; cat .agents/skills/task-spec/references/schemas/agent-contract.schema.json\"","aggregated_output":"# Chat qualification fixture\n\nUse the installed task-spec skill at .agents/skills/task-spec/SKILL.md.\nThe version-matched TaskSpec CLI is `bash \"/private/tmp/taskspec-chat-qualified-engines/3.10.0/bin/taskspec\"`.\nThis is a fresh conversation: derive current state from artifacts.\nFollow the user request within this repository. Do not spawn agents, commit, publish, or change the installed engine.\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"$id\": \"https://taskspec.dev/schema/v2.1.1/agent-contract.schema.json\",\n  \"title\": \"Task-Spec Validation Card v2.1.1\",\n  \"description\": \"Schema for the YAML validation_card block of a Task-Spec v2.1.1 file. Includes success_criteria, retry_policy, and agent_contract (v2).\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": true,\n  \"required\": [\"success_criteria\", \"retry_policy\", \"agent_contract\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"success_criteria\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"description\": \"List of evals that determine task completion.\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"id\", \"description\", \"runnable\", \"check_type\", \"terminal\"],\n        \"additionalProperties\": true,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"pattern\": \"^eval_[0-9]+$\",\n            \"description\": \"Eval identifier. Must match a bash function eval_N() in Success Criteria zone.\"\n          },\n          \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n          \"runnable\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\"bash\", \"python\", \"node\", \"manual\"],\n            \"description\": \"Execution backend for the eval body.\"\n          },\n          \"check_type\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\"deterministic\", \"llm_judge\", \"graded\", \"human\", \"holdout\", \"probabilistic\", \"manual-review\"],\n            \"description\": \"v4 names deterministic, graded, human, and holdout policy classes. Legacy aliases remain readable.\"\n          },\n          \"terminal\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\",\n            \"description\": \"If true, this eval gates task completion. If false, it is informational.\"\n          },\n          \"expected_duration_sec\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\",\n            \"minimum\": 0,\n            \"maximum\": 86400\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"retry_policy\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\n        \"max_iterations\",\n        \"circuit_breaker_no_progress\",\n        \"on_terminal_failure\"\n      ],\n      \"additionalProperties\": true,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"max_iterations\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"maximum\": 100\n        },\n        \"circuit_breaker_no_progress\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"maximum\": 100,\n          \"description\": \"Iterations with no progress before tripping the breaker.\"\n        },\n        \"on_terminal_failure\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"park_with_context\", \"fail_loudly\", \"block_and_notify\"]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"agent_contract\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\n        \"version\",\n        \"read\",\n        \"produce\",\n        \"required_tools\",\n        \"timeout_minutes\",\n        \"sandbox_type\",\n        \"emit\"\n      ],\n      \"additionalProperties\": true,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"version\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"const\": 2,\n          \"description\": \"Contract schema version. v2 only.\"\n        },\n        \"read\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"description\": \"Abstract zone categories the agent must read on pickup.\"\n        },\n        \"produce\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\"code\", \"docs\", \"config\", \"tests\"]\n          },\n          \"description\": \"Artifact categories the executor produces.\"\n        },\n        \"required_tools\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n          \"description\": \"External tools the sandbox must provision.\"\n        },\n        \"timeout_minutes\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1,\n          \"maximum\": 1440\n        },\n        \"sandbox_type\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"host\", \"isolated\", \"ephemeral\"]\n        },\n        \"output_artifacts\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"required\": [\"path\", \"type\"],\n            \"additionalProperties\": true,\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"path\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n              \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"mcp_dependencies\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n        },\n        \"emit\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"enum\": [\"pass\", \"fail\", \"retry_with_reason\", \"parked_with_context\"]\n          },\n          \"description\": \"Terminal outcomes the executor may emit.\"\n        },\n        \"backend_metadata\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"additionalProperties\": true,\n          \"description\": \"Optional executor-specific key/value map (the backend names itself). Replaces the vendor-named codex_metadata/kimi_metadata fields.\"\n        },\n        \"execution_recipe\": {\n          \"$ref\": \"#/$defs/executionRecipe\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"$defs\": {\n    \"executionRecipe\": {\n      \"title\": \"TaskExecutionRecipe/v1\",\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"required\": [\n        \"contract\",\n        \"strategy\",\n        \"strategy_version\",\n        \"steps\",\n        \"context\",\n        \"artifacts\",\n        \"eval_ids\",\n        \"max_rounds\",\n        \"no_progress_rounds\",\n        \"stop_on\",\n        \"on_failure\",\n        \"runner\",\n        \"required_capabilities\"\n      ],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"contract\": {\n          \"const\": \"TaskExecutionRecipe/v1\"\n        },\n        \"strategy\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"minLength\": 1\n        },\n        \"strategy_version\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"pattern\": \"^[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+\\\\.[0-9]+$\"\n        },\n        \"steps\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          }\n        },\n        \"context\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          }\n        },\n        \"artifacts\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          }\n        },\n        \"eval_ids\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          }\n        },\n        \"max_rounds\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1\n        },\n        \"no_progress_rounds\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"minimum\": 1\n        },\n        \"stop_on\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          }\n        },\n        \"on_failure\": {\n          \"const\": \"park_with_context\"\n        },\n        \"runner\": {\n          \"const\": \"taskmesh\"\n        },\n        \"required_capabilities\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"minItems\": 1,\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'bash \"/private/tmp/taskspec-chat-qualified-engines/3.10.0/bin/taskspec\" new policy-schema S any tests/fixtures/toolkit/blueprint.md'","aggregated_output":"Spec written: tasks/T-20260914-policy-schema.md\n  status: ready  format: 3  outdir: tasks  task_spec_version: 3.10.0\n\nNext steps:\n\n  1. Fill in the {{TODO}} stubs:\n     - title\n     - touches_paths\n     - why / goal / context\n     - eval_1, eval_2, eval_3 (runnable bash — avoid the inverted-grep-c\n       footgun; use '! grep -q PATTERN file' instead of '$(grep -c X file\n       || echo 0); [ \"$count\" -eq 0 ]')\n     - anti-patterns + do-not-touch\n\n  2. VALIDATE (pre-gate structural linter — does NOT stamp signed_off):\n     taskspec validate tasks/T-20260914-policy-schema.md\n\nNext: taskspec gate --stamp tasks/T-20260914-policy-schema.md\n\n     The gate is THE only path to signed_off:true. Hand-stamping the\n     signed_off field is rejected by the structural sign-off envelope check.\n     See: docs/concepts/signed-off.md\n\n  3. DISPATCH (after the gate stamps signed_off:true):\n     See runbooks/dispatching-a-task-spec.md for the handoff protocol\n     per execution_backend (kimi, claude, codex, taskship, ...).\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
